  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "Android 程式設計",
    "sub_ename": "ANDROID PROGRAMMING",
    "describe_ch": "本課程目的在使學生能夠在Android studio 環境下設計Android系統之App手機應用程式。課程從系統為App程式提供之介面元件開始，進一步使學生有能力撰寫自己的Activity ，並使用Intent來執行多個Activity以達成撰寫較實用的App應用程式，最後並介紹多媒體、資料庫、Google Map 等的應用程式撰寫。",
    "describe_eh": "This course teaches student having the ability to write the application program in the Android studio programming environment. The course starts with some Widgets provided by the Android studio system. After that the course teaches how to write an android activity. And, the intent is provided to write multiple activities program. Accordingly, the student can write more applicable App. In the end, this course introduces the following programming techniques: Multimedia, Data Base, and Google Map application.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
  },
